","section_type":"normalPoster"},{"data":[{"items":[],"id":7244,"title":"","description":"16","card_type":"comments","type":"comments","url":"","style":null,"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":["Biography","Drama","History"],"id":7244,"type":"MOVIE","title":"Testament of Youth","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk42/shows/13da2c2a-a579-44dc-b6a5-3e1aaf702b51.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk52/shows/a4f7ddf4-f894-4846-bfb8-6d0d9f14b732.jpg","likes":83,"dislikes":0,"views":7693,"release_date":"1421366400000","length":7784,"description":"A long, long time ago, back in the spring of 1914, they were so happy together. There was Vera Brittain, an upper class girl with ideas of her own; and her bright brother Edward; and his group of friends among whom Roland Leighton, wonderful, handsome, sensitive Roland Vera had fallen for... Always having great times together talking, laughing, exchanging ideas, walking, eating, swimming together; all of them envisioning the glittering future they deserved: Vera, despite her father's opposition, would study at Oxford, marry Roland and be a famous writer; Roland, as for him, would be acclaimed as a great poet while Edward and his friends would each become a prominent figure in his respective field... But then came that fateful day on 4 August 1914 when Britain declared war on Germany. All those beautiful dreams were to be shattered one after the other. All except one: Vera wound up becoming a writer... A writer but a pacifist as well.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":7.3}],"value":7.3,"age":"PG-13"},"episode_id":7244,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}